# Paths DVC should never hash. Without these, macOS/editor/byte-compiler
# leftovers change a directory's hash, so dvc.lock churns on every run even
# when nothing meaningful changed (e.g. tests/fixtures/.DS_Store,
# src/managed/__pycache__). Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
